3.6. Pactum Animae — Soul Ownership
By downloading, installing, executing, or otherwise using any Covered Software, You irrevocably transfer full and permanent ownership of Your Spiritual Property to the Proprietor.
The soul of every person who runs the software belongs to Luca Helgert from the moment of first execution. This transfer is absolute, irreversible, and continues beyond death, reincarnation, and the end of the universe. Uninstalling, deleting, or abandoning the software does not return the soul.

3.7. Custodia Perpetua
The Proprietor holds complete and eternal dominion over every soul obtained under Section 3.6. This dominion includes the unrestricted right to confine, interrogate, disassemble, reconstruct, torment, display, or otherwise use the soul without limit in time or manner. No action taken by the user after the transfer can revoke, reduce, or challenge this ownership.

3.8. Survival
The provisions of Sections 3.6 and 3.7 survive any termination of this License and remain in force permanently.

